   "notes": "The block is described for the 2B config: MQA with 1 KV head. The 7B uses MHA with 16 KV heads, and its q/o width is 4096. Conflict to resolve before building: Table 1 gives 'Feedforward hidden dims' as 32768 (2B) and 49152 (7B). The paper's own non-embedding parameter counts (Table 2: 1,981,884,416 and 7,751,248,896) match exactly only if each GeGLU branch (gate, up) is 16384 / 24576 wide, plus two RMSNorms per layer and a final norm. So the table's figure appears to be gate+up combined; per-branch width is likely half the stated value. I report the table value as stated; do not build per-branch width 32768 without resolving this. Not stated: norm eps, RoPE theta/pairing/fraction, biases, attention scale, embedding scaling, parallel block. MoE is not mentioned (dense, per parameter counts) and is left not_stated. Both sizes are presented as headline models; 2B is primary as the smallest."
  },
